      "value": "@{5ac4fd763f8d523278a414f7|full_name}: Already attempted to create a second head. Any bone in the amrature childed to the head will be scaled down with the head and anything external using physics will cause the transform to become desynced from the bone IK solved transform. In addition anything not directly attached to the head will not hide correctly from the camera potentially blocking the player view. As far as I know there is no known solution for attaching things to the head in VRChat that also fixes the behavior locally.",
      "viewerReactions": null
