      "mergeID": "5c120bda20f438507ae0eb38",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Patch for 2018.3.3 has suddenly made fixed joints break assigned locations and hover above the avatar. For instance I have a ball that tracks my hand by rigid body and fixed joints, but at a random time the ball no long is at my hand but has shot out to a distance above my head. The fixed joint no longer tracks position of the rigidbody, only rotation. I am forced to switch avatars to reset it.",
