  "details": "The new update broke Hinge Joints. Character Joints have been broken for a few months, I just accepted it was due to something added, perhaps how Camera is connected to us locally since it still worked for everyone else on their screen. But it seems the new update also broke Hinge joints. Basically Local for just the player the joints spaz out and flip out all over the screen. Below are some clips to demonstrate.\n\nHinge Joints\nhttps://clips.twitch.tv/PoorStrangeVelociraptorWholeWheat\n\nCharacter Joints\nhttps://clips.twitch.tv/BigAbstruseMelonJonCarnage\n\nWorlds with Hinge Joint Avatars\n\nKareeda's Avatar Airship -\n3 Avatar's here use them.\nwrld_6fa3969d-9425-4630-b51d-d9f66cbb71bf\n\nExample - Foxgirl's tail which is pet able not stabs through chest trying to fly away. http://prntscr.com/l75g89\nhttp://prntscr.com/l75h8p\n\nOther 2 avatars - \nhttp://prntscr.com/l75hpw\nhttp://prntscr.com/l75jgo\n\n\nAVATAR‘S YOU WANT FOR VR 〈TOUCHABLE AVATAR‘S>\nwrld_9c37a256-451e-4771-9d43-374cca19e193\n\nEvery single avatar in this world uses the method for touchable Physics I released how to do a few months ago. This video explains how so you can be aware of exactly how it is done. \nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ma-EP8vLCZc\n\n\nHopefully this helps fix it. If it was removed intentional please release that in patch notes and I will take down the video as I'd like all the people that created avatars using it as well as future creators to not spend their time working with this feature.\n\nThis is the kind of thing that makes VRChat amazing. Example below. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rEb5Ivfr-uA",
